      "when": "[Your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase).",
      "target": "An **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit of yours that has [disembarked](vsdata:core-rule/disembarking) from a **TRANSPORT** earlier in the turn and has not yet been **selected to shoot** in the phase.",
      "effect": "Whenever a model of the unit shoots at an enemy unit up to 6\" from it that is also in an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)'s range, the attack gets +1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls), for the rest of the phase. If those attacks **destroy** any enemy models, pick one of the **destroyed** models: its unit takes a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)."
    },
